silm:instances_papers_04_forge_chapters_01_gate_discipline_sections_03_arrow_typing_contract_concrete_anchor_4#measurementlegnode silm:hasLongDescription "The MeasurementLegNode is The typed olog node: MeasurementLeg. The type arrow lands here; 'body mass' types as MeasurementLeg. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'OlogNode (arrow chain)', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
